    "text": "If the coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup></math> in powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> are both zero, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
